# QMK's root .gitignore drops every *.png. The drawing templates are source,
# not build output, so keep them.
!oled_template*.png

# The snow art: make_snow.py's output is the input make_snow_header.py packs
# into oled_snow.h, so these PNGs are source too - and they are what lets the
# article claim the panel matches the drawing.
!snow_*.png

# Generated previews (build_soflepico/sync_to_keymap.py) - keep those too, so
# the keymap folder carries its own pictures.
!preview/**/*.png
!preview/**/*.gif
!preview/**/*.svg
